        "subject": "LU-18687 build: remove C plugin support",
        "message": "LU-18687 build: remove C plugin support\n\nThe plugin for detecting static functions has been superseded\nby newer version of gcc/clang, along with checkers like\nsmatch/sparse. To simplify our transition away from autotools,\nremove C plugin support. Developers could still manually pass\nC flags to use C plugins, if desired.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Timothy Day <timday@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: I93eb2ad3da46f1fd7cccd8b1c2f8e109d4e86e02\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
